<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Still Alive - From the Original Motion Picture Scream VI</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Demi Lovato</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Still Alive (From the Original Motion Picture Scream VI)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4Gnbk3CFlF1Qt0nTiz693B</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.630" end="00:06.840">Woke up underwater, throat chained at the collar</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.840" end="00:10.460">Couldn't get any farther from the daylight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.460" end="00:13.890">Was I still dreamin', stuck to a machine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.890" end="00:17.580">Or chokin' and screamin' with my hands tied?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.580" end="00:20.900">Callin' and callin', but nobody comes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.900" end="00:24.590">Fallin' and fallin', no air in my lungs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.590" end="00:26.960">Gettin' so comfortably numb</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.960" end="00:29.940">Don't know how I opened up my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.940" end="00:33.100">But I'm still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.100" end="00:37.690">I don't wanna just survive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.690" end="00:40.740">Give me somethin' to sink all my teeth in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.740" end="00:44.600">Eat the devil and spit out my demons</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.600" end="00:51.060">Still alive, already died a thousand times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.060" end="00:54.790">Went to Hell, but I'm back and I'm breathin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.790" end="00:58.070">Make me bleed while my heart is still beatin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.070" end="01:05.100">Still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.100" end="01:08.540">Sucked out the poison, drowned out the noise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.540" end="01:11.900">'Cause I made a choice and drew a hard line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.900" end="01:15.510">Let the fire catch until I'm back to ash</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.510" end="01:19.390">If anybody asks, I'm turnin' back time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.390" end="01:22.910">Chasin' the ghosts that would haunt me at night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.910" end="01:26.320">Facin' my past 'cause I'm up for the fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.320" end="01:28.600">Somebody turned on the light</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.600" end="01:31.630">I'm not afraid to open up my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.630" end="01:34.750">But I'm still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.750" end="01:38.900">I don't wanna just survive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.900" end="01:42.620">Give me somethin' to sink all my teeth in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.620" end="01:46.020">Eat the devil and spit out my demons</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.020" end="01:48.550">Still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.550" end="01:53.120">Already died a thousand times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.120" end="01:56.360">Went to Hell, but I'm back and I'm breathin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.360" end="02:00.400">Make me bleed while my heart is still beatin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.400" end="02:07.590">Already died</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.590" end="02:13.250">Suddenly, I'm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.250" end="02:16.280">Still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.280" end="02:20.190">I don't wanna just survive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.190" end="02:24.050">Give me somethin' to sink all my teeth in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.050" end="02:27.240">Eat the devil and spit out my demons</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.240" end="02:29.840">Still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.840" end="02:34.040">Already died a thousand times</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.040" end="02:37.450">Went to Hell, but I'm back and I'm breathin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.450" end="02:41.180">Make me bleed while my heart is still beatin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.180" end="02:47.540">Still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.540" end="02:54.610">Still alive</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.610" end="02:59.860" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Still alive)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.860" end="03:03.860" /></div></body></tt>